  annotation = {TLDR: Interestingly, the proposed effects capture the path-specific effects of an exposure on an outcome that are mediated by distinct mediators, even when-as often-the structural dependence between the multiple mediators is unknown, for instance, when the direction of the causal effects between the mediator isunknown, or there may be unmeasured common causes of the mediators.},
